 "Mano Tendida": "Outstretched Hand",
 "Le diste a Hela lo que nadie le dio: otra oportunidad.": "You gave Hela what no one ever gave her: another chance.",
 "Elegir el perdón en la Tundra": "Choose forgiveness in the Tundra",
 "Balanza de Aurelia": "Scales of Aurelia",
 "La justicia duele. Por eso pesa.": "Justice hurts. That's why it weighs.",
 "Elegir la justicia en la Tundra": "Choose justice in the Tundra",
 "Amigo del Yunque": "Friend of the Anvil",
 "Goreth te forjó una herradura. Goreth no le forja nada a nadie.": "Goreth forged you a horseshoe. Goreth doesn't forge anything for anyone.",
 "Avisarle a Goreth del plan de Bruno": "Warn Goreth about Bruno's plan",
 "Cómplice de Calabazas": "Pumpkin Accomplice",
 "Lo que pasó en el guiso de Goreth, queda en el guiso de Goreth.": "What happened in Goreth's stew stays in Goreth's stew.",
 "Seguirle la broma a Bruno": "Go along with Bruno's prank",
 "Matatitanes": "Titan Slayer",
 "Era grande. Ahora es grande y está en el suelo.": "It was big. Now it's big and on the ground.",
 "el Titán de la Pradera": "the Titan of the Meadow",
 "Destronador": "Dethroner",
 "La montaña tuvo un rey. Ahora tiene una historia.": "The mountain had a king. Now it has a story.",
 "el Rey de la Montaña": "the Mountain King",
 "Apagafuegos": "Firefighter",
 "Hace falta mucho valor para pelear con un volcán que camina.": "It takes a lot of courage to fight a walking volcano.",
 "el Titán de Fuego": "the Fire Titan",
 "Lo Que Duerme Abajo": "What Sleeps Below",
 "Bajaste donde no llega la luz y volviste para contarlo.": "You went down where the light doesn't reach and came back to tell the tale.",
 "la Bestia de las Profundidades": "the Beast of the Depths",
 "Deshielo": "Thaw",
 "Un rey de hielo, una corona rota y un invierno menos.": "An ice king, a broken crown and one less winter.",
 "el Rey del Hielo": "the Ice King",
 "Fin de la Eternidad": "End of Eternity",
 "El Lich creía que era eterno. Se equivocó por poco.": "The Lich thought it was eternal. It was off by a little.",
 "el Lich Ancestral": "the Ancient Lich",
 "Huesos de Estrella": "Star Bones",
 "Hasta los gigantes del abismo tienen un último día.": "Even the giants of the abyss have a last day.",
 "el Gran Esqueleto del Abismo": "the Great Skeleton of the Abyss",
 "Cazador de Leyendas": "Legend Hunter",
 "Hay bestias de las que solo se habla en las tabernas. Tú las conociste a todas.": "There are beasts people only talk about in taverns. You met them all.",
 "Matar a los 7 jefes de zona": "Kill the 7 zone bosses",
 "La Cripta Calla": "The Crypt Falls Silent",
 "El Vigía Caído descansa. Los braseros, no.": "The Fallen Watcher rests. The braziers don't.",
 "la Cripta del Vigía": "the Watcher's Crypt",
 "Minero de Fondo": "Deep Miner",
 "En la Mina Profunda ya no se escuchan martillazos que no son de nadie.": "In the Deep Mine you no longer hear hammering that belongs to no one.",
 "la Mina Profunda": "the Deep Mine",
 "Cruzar la Fisura": "Crossing the Rift",
 "Bajaste al infierno con una antorcha. Volviste con dos.": "You went down into hell with one torch. You came back with two.",
 "la Fisura Infernal": "the Infernal Rift",
 "Aire Prestado": "Borrowed Air",
 "En el Arrecife Hundido aprendiste a contener la respiración. Y la rabia.": "In the Sunken Reef you learned to hold your breath. And your rage.",
 "el Arrecife Hundido": "the Sunken Reef",
 "La Reina Ya No Llora": "The Queen Weeps No More",
 "En la Cripta Congelada, el hielo por fin se derritió un poco.": "In the Frozen Crypt, the ice finally melted a little.",
 "la Cripta Congelada": "the Frozen Crypt",
 "Sin Trono": "Throneless",
 "Le quitaste la silla a la muerte. No le gustó.": "You took death's chair away. It didn't like that.",
 "el Trono de Huesos": "the Throne of Bones",
 "El Ojo Se Cierra": "The Eye Closes",
 "En el Observatorio Roto, por fin, nadie te mira.": "In the Broken Observatory, at last, no one is watching you.",
 "el Observatorio Roto": "the Broken Observatory",
 "Rata de Mazmorra": "Dungeon Rat",
 "Ya no le temes a la oscuridad. La oscuridad te tiene un poco de miedo a ti.": "You're no longer afraid of the dark. The dark is a little afraid of you.",
 "Vencer 50 jefes de mazmorra (sumando todas)": "Defeat 50 dungeon bosses (all of them combined)",
 "Lobo Solitario": "Lone Wolf",
 "Nadie te cubrió la espalda. Nadie hizo falta.": "No one watched your back. No one needed to.",
 "Matar a un jefe de zona tú solo": "Kill a zone boss on your own",
 "Una Sola Antorcha": "A Single Torch",
 "Entraste solo, saliste solo. La mazmorra quedó vacía.": "You went in alone, you came out alone. The dungeon was left empty.",
 "Vencer al jefe de una mazmorra tú solo": "Defeat a dungeon boss on your own",
 "Cien Duelos": "A Hundred Duels",
 "Cien peleas a solas. Ya ni te tiembla la mano.": "A hundred fights on your own. Your hand doesn't even shake anymore.",
 "Ganar 100 combates tú solo": "Win 100 fights on your own",
 "Al Filo": "On the Edge",
 "Un golpe más y no lo cuentas. Pero lo cuentas.": "One more blow and you wouldn't live to tell it. But you do.",
 "Ganarle a un jefe con menos del 5% de vida": "Beat a boss with less than 5% health",
 "Rey de la Manada": "King of the Pack",
 "Los lobos aúllan cuando pasas. De respeto.": "The wolves howl when you pass. Out of respect.",
 "Terror de los Caminos": "Terror of the Roads",
 "Los bandidos cambian de ruta cuando te ven.": "Bandits change their route when they see you.",
 "Descansen en Paz": "Rest in Peace",
