 "muertos vivientes": "undead",
 "Domador de Elementos": "Tamer of Elements",
 "El fuego, el agua y la piedra te reconocen.": "Fire, water and stone recognize you.",
 "Lobo de Mar": "Sea Wolf",
 "Ya no le temes a nada que tenga escamas o tentáculos.": "You're no longer afraid of anything with scales or tentacles.",
 "acuáticos": "aquatic",
 "Cazafantasmas": "Ghostbuster",
